title: "Metadata Grounding versus Prompt Engineering in Compute-Constrained Vision-Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code and released outputs for a controlled comparison of metadata
  grounding against prompt engineering for factual product demonstration generation
  by small vision-language models.
